From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:43:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] KitKat UI P13: key text size attrs + flat key colors
 (13.4)

KeyboardView.KitKat carried no key text SIZE attrs - the modern
KeyboardView base style sets none (modern themes define them
per-theme), so KeyVisualAttributes read 0 and on-key labels painted
at setTextSize(0): invisible keys, working previews. Ported the
donor KeyboardView.KLP size set (letter 55%, large letter 65%,
label 34%, hint letter 25%, hint label 44%, shifted hint 35%,
preview 82%) and repointed keyTextColor/keyPreviewTextColor at
flat colors (getColor() cannot resolve the donor selector).
